    "text": "with Ada.Text_IO; use Ada.Text_IO;\n\nprocedure Greet is\n   type Days is (Monday, Tuesday, Wednesday,\n                 Thursday, Friday,\n                 Saturday, Sunday);\n\n   type Weekend_Days is new\n     Days range Saturday .. Sunday;\n   --  New type, where only Saturday and Sunday\n   --  are valid literals.\nbegin\n   null;\nend Greet;\n",
